==German==

===Etymology===
From {{der|de|gml|suppe}}, {{m|gml|soppe}}, {{m|gml|sope}}, which spread under the reinforcing influence of {{der|de|fr|soupe}}. Both from {{der|de|gem-pro|*supô}}, {{m|gem-pro|*suppô}}, which is related to {{cog|de|saufen||to drink}}.

